      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "包包里装着创可贴和绷带。\r\n这样就不怕冒失受伤了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe7a5bb8082758ef3b2d5d5ecbb294526c72d9de2c966bd8d8a0791a7d16a8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c582f04baa7d838537517c37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着灯笼的火焰，会感到很放松呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81c4c220cb09b651db63fd136674b8401f1d4595e12ed522215e448af400587b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f886ab434c1465686a2cb60d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收在袖子里的点心，都掉出来了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f09bcd13f5ef4290a8dcbc9ac09edaddda0b35a961346dfa3a6262ecc4f78653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b66b5d9c4279a329beb6cc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a93402554c851c294fa17a86e09545ac448b5c8b1596635e17c61e567ce865ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bded6c9303a8efe06f872963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我会努力赢的……我能赢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7801c0a9c3101dba627ed9729b21b080e77734f55ea763b2b9aa1ea7c57aa740",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a7d10674332134184373fa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛、辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "434971ca5a08c2f72f5dd8dc81fc1ae00f277b431b213745dc506a8ea4419f04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b915a496bcff59e7a474e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "しょ、勝負です…！\r\n………ひえぇ、\r\n言っちゃったぁぁぁ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48d1c8f41229e1e6e367b914b178731eea34780330db0692a120bf4da7903273",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2413eb7b67acdcb3858f201b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あうぅ…ま、まだいけます…。\r\n私、まだがんばれます…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df5ef4c279b4ca2d201af9da24a84c73f55c2b284f969cca0baf4f87cb262e8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c93df140484284b5922a6968",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安～\r\n……请问我头发应该没有乱吧……？\r\n应该没有乱七八糟的吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "529692acd0ada44056338a5aa51d5cacc53346a4799f75f258717d25aed9a9cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5946953bc1e6ead06a60098",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好歌剧和乌拉拉她们两个，\r\n每次都是一早就很有精神哦～\r\n我也要向她们看齐才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b703fc5a2915b015c805dc448395cc26c2e7c09ca8c466b3286a7af18fe2729b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aa6d10d8572184e084023ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经吃过午餐了吗？\r\n我……因为面包被小鸟抢走了，\r\n所以要再去买一次……",
      "source_fingerprint": "47f55e13f2fb31b0f5b74a25dcc4067956bc0f1096c3243e3dfc0415c7600341",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:082efee47893069110f6a19e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐过后总是会很想睡觉……\r\n要小心不要像之前一样，\r\n走错到隔壁教室去才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc8f319ce48747a7be624ceda2c9d93792b78171b97a996e54321e2e20ae8daa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e16e0d3e1eec3a648ee9656d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上会让人觉得很平静呢……\r\n有种……心情沮丧、低落，\r\n好像也没关系的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9b9728305b4e35096269648a583c6ba0949ea956a4e087aef8301316d645233",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1078c2cca52af2f703f8881",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天一整天也辛苦了～\r\n明天我会努力不制造麻烦的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ac558e90af4a47bab3586af2851f2f64e003f0f1799dfc14f747bf453cac78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc7acb74a7361d46a13c3ca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想着在新生面前要抬头挺胸……\r\n结、结果，不小心抽筋了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "af4a7b43b78cc9b8f49e707dbf3155b5fe82433afee22fdcab7bb5c7eedfc8c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a138ace0747dd1bf27b038",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天……虽然我很怕热，\r\n但向日葵和耀眼的阳光……\r\n我就好像还满喜欢的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3d9c153277628861ff7a4ff7d05662fa5540cb46663478dde64d33bc3e0bd75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21544247219855cf37499fa9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老师在课堂上出了一个题目叫──\r\n「自己的秋天是什么样子？」……\r\n也有适合我、属于我的秋天吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7eb0691c2f536a60efbdf06b73aecee074b660f6d00b61fe68b4a6f357128f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16e158539c20ffa1839af992",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我冬天的时候没有那么怕冷，\r\n毕竟小时候是在北方长大的，\r\n而且我还有暖呼呼的手套～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b229ce0605ba7be761fe4851fe25e51d94c353a4fe9c193d1c79944413b0c42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de85c9820383849b4ca8358a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n我来替你带路……咦？\r\n今天鬼屋还没正式开张！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0058b18b58ed05fd9a0bf96c72ae22748e56ceb716e8565bec1ea7260d0a436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f76d58b42e47682346528896",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "丝、丝袜破洞了……！啊呜……\r\n之前被神宫提醒之后，\r\n才换过一件的说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "17634626aae8290bb2579c5be5fa098f80833234dce5c509df5da46e4785aed8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54cb487eecccff9553e7fe55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鬼屋里又暗又恐怖……\r\n……啊，如果跟白天一样亮的话，\r\n就连胆子小的人也能玩了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9b538f0de0e21f85db92e285565e0d62e8ab17018e6b1fe2ad88c40de09e5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9670da7b11b753bbd003798",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……对不起。\r\n替大家做的南瓜派……\r\n现在只剩下焦炭了～～",
      "source_fingerprint": "937730bf38a0fc7be034ab30999f1566ecb89cf46264a531b8d6e0397b797a37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52b1df3095d305b56d8d26b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这、这里很暗，\r\n走路要小心一点喔……！\r\n虽然、我在亮的地方也会跌倒……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0bc345f0f8f5e974003a6748af4eb2aa58c30bc311848b464fec16662ec9342",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d99f741286de13a820926b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀啊！？训练员！？\r\n那我刚才主动搭话却被忽视\r\n是因为……噫～！我认错人了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bf5f0547713b2271b259ae0e6efe308235174b41046fa777fe12d1453c5d2d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6742bd116dd1548b37a2433c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春、春天的风真可怕呢。\r\n我曾经追着被风吹走的帽子，\r\n结果遇难……我已经怕了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ddbd33501e21bdfac0d15c104d6cf9233b8ed69fcfc357e6a217ba35afdd658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd618a2e45e441375b4d0502",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "采收起来的巨大南瓜被我弄掉后，\r\n就裂成了两半……\r\n我会花一辈子的时间补偿～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7459b654d4cb60c21a049f063a01c02ea5f8262f1407bd9ab6fd726b3ad182f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a32a1a264c77a64340164291",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所、所谓的捣蛋，\r\n到底该怎么做才好……！呜呜……\r\n压力让我开始头晕了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5715cce65f713401184fd96461864dc830986549a153a62798429d4a709bd49f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a3fb2078a07add6bf6ecfa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在天气冷的时候把帽子放在外面，\r\n结果有小狸猫钻进去。当我发现时\r\n它已经在里面睡着了……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "994a17914dc016de31054acc858c6877fd6393235e14d1a5862a050a3141c6d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeac22f6479f6b809f230f0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情、情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a6ffc9161024d8b88b1cfe73fa8db72a5ab444a7d7577c34ba02a341922b476",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4632edb215995aafa6c83b49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情、情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a6ffc9161024d8b88b1cfe73fa8db72a5ab444a7d7577c34ba02a341922b476",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59b0c4d217c8f06319449fa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情低落的时候，\r\n不会想要躲起来吗？\r\n像是躲在阴暗处，或是谁的背后……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a49f1571c652250057f739701c9730c7415a7c1cc3b8fca5e948c4fa6855205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45d0d58f5489616ceccec632",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的父母真的非常温柔哦。\r\n都会说「怒涛是了不起的孩子」……\r\n明明我一点都不优秀的说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6997e3600c96e6d366375b689a8898139837582d057ed8f8595cdbbed975d54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca90065ec52dff1fe9d718ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……我正是世纪末霸王！\r\n哈──哈哈哈！！\r\n…………有、有像吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "460a41fc380d69160598f7bcdbb586a8364c5d63b8d3fa18c7b68d1b522f7cab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:004485edfdba0d9683687042",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也希望自己跟好歌剧的关系\r\n能像织姬那样……\r\n不行，那样太令人惶恐了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "045145ff03b790b786d6f43a4a6a1cfdaa0b180049973bf87ec45063a6d51cc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:921b4cac821f3dd41fce9f1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哇哇……\r\n大树快车约我参加派对，\r\n但我会不会很突兀啊……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a14541adf81e6a5fadbd8eef7dcdb7bd11ce723f49b49a045a2ddae7dd5300b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
